<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12104"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 23, 2005 - 5:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Im going to try to find something on the anna poem, in the beatty book it says the name lois or louis was crossed out and anna was inserted. <BR>So, my search will start with &#34;oh louis&#34;. I will let ya&#39;ll know if I find anything.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
